{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>S</strong>TORY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now that a snowstorm has devastated the region, the only way to continue your journey is through the castle of the mysterious Baron Fetuccini. <br>Arriving at the castle, you discover a nightmare from which it seems impossible to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore varied labyrinthine environments in a non-linear way, solve puzzles and riddles, and carefully manage your resources in this survival horror game where the slightest encounter can be fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is also a precious resource. Be careful, when night falls, you could find yourself facing the most dangerous threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOLVE THE MYSTERIES OF THE CASTLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet other characters who are also trapped in the castle. Assisting them may help you unlock the secrets behind the mysterious Funskin project.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3232650?t=1763739834","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232650/2f7f8859a8406c4572f024fea957c2a293b07818/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763739834","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232650/e261d18b3e5efda12fd52f58eb08df0fa7fb3969/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763739834","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232650/e261d18b3e5efda12fd52f58eb08df0fa7fb3969/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763739834","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains sytlised depcitions of violence and gore, as well as slightly foul language."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>S</strong>TORY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now that a snowstorm has devastated the region, the only way to continue your journey is through the castle of the mysterious Baron Fetuccini. <br>Arriving at the castle, you discover a nightmare from which it seems impossible to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore varied labyrinthine environments in a non-linear way, solve puzzles and riddles, and carefully manage your resources in this survival horror game where the slightest encounter can be fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is also a precious resource. Be careful, when night falls, you could find yourself facing the most dangerous threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOLVE THE MYSTERIES OF THE CASTLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet other characters who are also trapped in the castle. Assisting them may help you unlock the secrets behind the mysterious Funskin project.</p>","developers":["Studio Richoux"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3232650/21d9a688f585e6a4b4089e775f21d0d4bbbed49a/header.jpg?t=1763739834","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3232650/466673358/dee680f80d5efc8e736a6aacbf1d8221cc1ff6c2/1763738968/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763739833","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3232650/466673358/dee680f80d5efc8e736a6aacbf1d8221cc1ff6c2/1763738968/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763739833","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3232650/466673358/dee680f80d5efc8e736a6aacbf1d8221cc1ff6c2/1763738968/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763739833","id":257235881,"name":"Gameplay Teaser - 2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257235881